    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d203">

                <pb facs="0296" n="220" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg220"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.00/1781</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister Russell </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-01-24T18:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 24, 1916, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your telegrams January 19, 5 p.m., and January 3, 8 a.m. Reaffirm purpose of this
                    Government as set forth in the Department’s telegrams of November 26, 5
                        p.m.,<anchor n="2" xml:id="d203-f1"/> and December 2, 11 a.m.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d203-f2"/> and inform President Jiménez that this Government will,
                    if requested, furnish the forces necessary to suppress insurrection and maintain
                    order.</p>
                <pb facs="0297" n="221" xml:id="pg221"/>
                <p>In assuring the President of this support, however, you will embrace the
                    opportunity to impress upon him the danger of affording any pretext for
                    criticism, cause for impeachment by Congress, or open opposition to his
                    Government; and say further that this Government desires to be assured that in
                    view of such support he will spare no pains or apparent sacrifice to insure
                    honest, efficient and popular Government for his people.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
